{"id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-wkl0.md","title":"Weak König's Lemma","display":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-wkl0","aliases":["72-df-wkl0"],"display":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]]","[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]","[[72-df-base-system]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Simpson, SOSOA 2nd-edition draft (2006), Definition I.10.1, print37/PDF46, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf; local explicit binary-code PR definition extension; Handbook Ch.IV §3.2.3 is related context","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"固定WKL的PR语言、三个程序身份与定义扩充公理","source_kind":"supplementary-primary-source-with-explicit-local-encoding"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-wkl0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-wkl0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5706cc0c55f220a\" href=\"?note=c5706cc0c55f220a\" title=\"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness\">72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0631285f0a620556\" href=\"?note=0631285f0a620556\" title=\"72-df-binary-sequence-programs\">72-df-binary-sequence-programs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Simpson, SOSOA 2nd-edition draft (2006), Definition I.10.1, print37/PDF46, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>; local explicit binary-code PR definition extension; Handbook Ch.IV §3.2.3 is related context"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"固定WKL的PR语言、三个程序身份与定义扩充公理"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-source-with-explicit-local-encoding"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}\">\\(c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0631285f0a620556\" href=\"?note=0631285f0a620556\" title=\"72-df-binary-sequence-programs\">72-df-binary-sequence-programs</a>，程序解释对应由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c5706cc0c55f220a\" href=\"?note=c5706cc0c55f220a\" title=\"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness\">72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness</a> 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},f_c\">\\(E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},f_c\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>；对象语法固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})\">\\(\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a> 的基语言公理集合，在扩充语言中按相同语法树包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}\">\\(\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}\\)</span> 由下式加入全部 PR 定义方程；这里不额外加入任意新语言的归纳或概括模式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X\\in V_S\">\\(T,X\\in V_S\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,k,n,i\">\\(s,k,n,i\\)</span> 为互异数变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(t),\\operatorname{bit}(t,u),\\operatorname{pref}(t,u)\">\\(\\ell(t),\\operatorname{bit}(t,u),\\operatorname{pref}(t,u)\\)</span> 是下式的实际函数项缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为数项。对象公式中的幂与串的外部集合不作未声明的原始符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(t):=f_{\\mathsf{blen}}(t),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bit}(t,u):=f_{\\mathsf{bbit}}(t,u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pref}(t,u):=f_{\\mathsf{bpref}}(t,u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(t):=f_{\\mathsf{blen}}(t),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bit}(t,u):=f_{\\mathsf{bbit}}(t,u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pref}(t,u):=f_{\\mathsf{bpref}}(t,u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall s\\,(s\\in T\\to\\forall k\\le\\ell(s)\\ (\\operatorname{pref}(s,k)\\in T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,(s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&amp;:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall s\\,(s\\in T\\to\\forall k\\le\\ell(s)\\ (\\operatorname{pref}(s,k)\\in T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,(s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&amp;:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原来的∀T⊆2^{&lt;N}量化是元理论集合量化；现在WKL是明确的L2句子。每个X的特征位确定唯一长度n串，故Branch条件保证前缀相容。Tree前提不可省略：每层存在节点本身不保证一条共同路径。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：旧稿在基本 L₂(∅) 的公理集合中直接使用 ℓ、bit、pref，而其 PR 符号和定义方程只由“保守定义使用”文字承担。现固定三个实际程序标签，明确扩充语言与 Def_PR；因此每条 WKL 公理都是该语言中的句子。此前的基本语言保守性结果仍只比较旧语言句子，PR 定义扩充的保守性依赖各固定 PR 函数在 RCA₀ 中可证全性；本条没有把该一般消去证明冒称已经在此机器重建。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23 来源复核：标准 WKL₀ 以 RCA₀ 加无限二叉树分支原则定义，对应 Simpson I.10.1。本地使用明确二进制串代码及全部 PR 定义方程，属于该原理的显式语言扩充呈现；《Handbook》IV§3.2.3 的 NT 与概括系统不是本地零下标系统的字面定义来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"c5706cc0c55f220a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-binary-sequence-programs","status":"resolved","id":"0631285f0a620556","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-base-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-binary-sequence-programs","status":"resolved","id":"0631285f0a620556","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}$ 采用 [[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]，程序解释对应由 [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] 给出。$E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},f_c$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；对象语法固定为 $\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"c5706cc0c55f220a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}$ 采用