\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i<n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0^{\\rm PR}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3650,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-wkl0|df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma]]"},{"id":"ca4d81197c96530e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\mathsf{PA}$ 是 [[72-df-base-system]]、[[72-df-wkl0]]、[[72-df-aca0]]、[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的公理句集合；$\\vdash_2$ 是 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的实际有限两类变量Hilbert推导。"},{"id":"c92e0574d85ca895","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5e5fb64772853785","c5706cc0c55f220a","0631285f0a620556","8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","1a814f5220a079de"]}